stack-problem-empty
    Add frames to stack.
stack-problem-empty-ios
    Add frames, or take a burst.
stack-problem-too-few
    Include at least 2 frames.
stack-problem-missing (n=0)
    0 included frames can't be found.
stack-problem-missing (n=1)
    1 included frame can't be found.
stack-problem-missing (n=2)
    2 included frames can't be found.
stack-problem-missing (n=1000)
    1000 included frames can't be found.
stack-problem-mixed-linear-dng
    The included frames mix linear DNGs, such as ProRAW, with other formats. Include only those DNGs, or only the others.
stack-problem-mixed-raw
    The included frames mix RAW files with JPEG, HEIC or other formats. Include only RAW files, or only the others.
no-frames
    There are no frames to stack.
no-frames-advice
    Add frames, or include the excluded ones.
frame-size
    <file> is <size>, but the stack's first frame is <first>. Every frame must be the size of the first.
same-size-advice
    Check that all come from the same camera and crop mode, that none is already stacked or edited, and that all were converted the same way.
unnamed-profile
    an unnamed color profile
mixed-kinds-raw
    <file> is a RAW or DNG file, but <first> is a standard image. A stack must be all RAW and DNG files or all standard images, such as JPEG, PNG and TIFF.
mixed-kinds-standard
    <file> is a standard image, but <first> is a RAW or DNG file. A stack must be all RAW and DNG files or all standard images, such as JPEG, PNG and TIFF.
mixed-kinds-advice
    Exclude the frames of the other kind.
mixed-renders-compare
    A render of RAW frames and a render of standard images can't be compared.
mixed-renders-paint
    A render of RAW frames can't be painted from a render of standard images, or the other way around.
no-shared-frame
    The two renders share no frame, so they can't be lined up for comparing.
not-raw
    Only a stack of RAW or DNG frames can be exported as DNG.
export-as-tiff
    Export it as TIFF instead.
needs-pyramid
    Grow sequences can be made only from Pyramid renders.
