pref-grid-rotation-help
    0 turns the rotation search off.
pref-grid-magnification
    Magnification (%)
pref-grid-magnification-help
    0 turns the magnification search off.
pref-exposure-compensation
    Exposure compensation
pref-exposure-compensation-help
    Scale each frame to the first frame's brightness. For stacks shot at varying exposure only: on a normal rail stack it measures vignetting, not exposure, and darkens the result.
